// https://nitro.unjs.io/guide/typescript
//
// The template's: Nitro writes .nitro/types/tsconfig.json (the auto-imports
// such as defineEventHandler, and the server/ sources) on `nitro prepare`,
// which the package's `prepare` and `typecheck` scripts run first. That file
// includes every file of the package with allowJs, so the lint config (and
// the shared one it imports) is excluded here: it is checked by eslint, not
// by the app's types. Strict, as the rest of the workspace is.
{
  "extends": "./.nitro/types/tsconfig.json",
  "compilerOptions": {
    "strict": true
  },
  "exclude": ["eslint.config.js", "node_modules", ".output"]
}
